{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.poster.avif?t=1764406673\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.webm?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.mp4?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An outside threat appears at  Fjor's homeland, a quiet northern island. She's not yet strong enough, but  born under Guardian's celestial blessing, she must unlock her inner powers, unite the spirits of ancient heroes and fulfill her duty to protect what's sacred to her people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, get stronger, and triumph. As you move towards your goal, explore the island's surface and underground: forgotten caves and\u00a0ominous swamps, gloomy catacombs and sacred ruins, where you shall fight hordes of monsters and discover well-hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intricate Combat System </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.poster.avif?t=1764406673\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.webm?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.mp4?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of one-button combat? Inspired by the best of hack'n'slash genre, Divinum has wide possibilities for you to master and experiment with. Launch enemies into the air, where they are unable to act and escape, but Fjor gets access to unique moves. Unleash unstoppable combos with two distinct primary weapons and special skills. Leave your foes no chance with quick dodges, block and parry!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Impactful Collectible Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.poster.avif?t=1764406673\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.webm?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.mp4?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, look for secrets and fight bosses to find Runes that meaningfully change how you fight. +5% damage item? You won't find anything this boring in Divinum. Runes can provide anything from solid unique bonuses to modifiers that can completely change how you approach battles <strong>\u2014 </strong>but they may come with trade-offs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Test Your Skills and Get Rewarded</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.poster.avif?t=1764406673\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.webm?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.mp4?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the island, ancient evil lies in wait. Challenge the cursed foes of old and claim the rewards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1148130?t=1764406673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1148130?t=1764406673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/d31e35d8698a1dd0fa221b35341d54de51117059/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764406673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/d31e35d8698a1dd0fa221b35341d54de51117059/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764406673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4196020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.poster.avif?t=1764406673\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.webm?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.mp4?t=1764406673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra